# An allowlist: Vercel uploads only what the build and the functions need.
# Keys under .demo/, Rust build output, and everything else stay local. The
# proving files are fetched from the ceremony-v1 release and checked by hash.
/*
!/package.json
!/package-lock.json
!/vercel.json
!/api
!/sdk
!/web
!/tempo
/tempo/*
!/tempo/deployments
/tempo/deployments/31337*
!/solana
/solana/*
!/solana/deployments
/solana/deployments/local*
/sdk/node_modules
/sdk/test
/web/node_modules
/web/public/zk
/web/dist
